<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">FastVLM: Self-Speculative Decoding for Fast Vision-Language Model Inference</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Divya Jyoti Bajpai
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
